# Claude Code harness.
# .claude/settings.json, .claude/hooks/, and .claude/skills/ are SHARED — they
# are the project's agent configuration and must be committed. Only the
# per-developer local overrides are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Tauri generated files (produced by `cargo tauri build` / `tauri codegen`).
# The ACL manifests and other schemas under gen/ are build artifacts; keeping
# them in git clutters history with single-line changes on every regeneration.
xdl-chart-viewer/gen/

# Figures written into the repo root by graphics tests. The real fix is to run
# them in a temp dir (scripts/run-xdl-suite.sh does); this keeps a stray run
# from being committed. See AGENTS.md -> Test Isolation.
/xdl_plot.png
/xdl_plot3d.png
/xdl_surface.png
/xdl_shade_surf.png
/xdl_contour.png
*.db
*.tsx
*.drawio
